	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ECHAMPION_TRMSG_1ST_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ときに　はるかぜの　ように　まい
あるいは　いなづまの　ように　さす▼
そんな　ほれぼれ　するような
たたかいを　みせて　もらいましょう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T12:48:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ときに　春風の　ように　舞い
あるいは　稲妻の　ように　刺す▼
そんな　ほれぼれ　するような
戦いを　みせて　もらいましょう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T12:49:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・チャンピオン：ミクリ
・１回戦用対戦前メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ECHAMPION
ミクリ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T10:17:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ECHAMPION_TRMSG_2ND_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きみと……　きみの　ポケモンが
ちからを　あわせたからこそ▽
こんなんを　のりこえ　ここに　きた▽
その　つよさ　みせてもらいましょう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T12:48:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きみと……　きみの　ポケモンが
力を　合わせたからこそ▽
困難を　乗り越え　ここに　来た▽
その強さ　みせてもらいましょう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T12:48:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・チャンピオン：ミクリ
・２回戦用対戦前メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ECHAMPION
ミクリ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T10:17:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ECHAMPION_TRMSG_3RD_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さあ！　いちばん
かれいに　ポケモンと▽
おどれるのは　だれなのか！▽
いま　ここで　みせて　もらおう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さあ！　一番
華麗に　ポケモンと▽
踊れるのは　だれなのか！▽
いま　ここで　みせて　もらおう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T12:42:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・チャンピオン：ミクリ
・決勝戦用対戦前メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ECHAMPION
