	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ECHAMPION_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんと　ワンダフル！▼
にくらしいほど　エレガント！▼
だけど　とっても　グロリアス！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんと　ワンダフル！▼
憎らしいほど　エレガント！▼
だけど　とっても　グロリアス！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T12:43:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
