	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ECHAMPION_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_PLAYER_WIN"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ミクリ『すばらしい！▼
きみが　ほんとうに　すばらしい！
ポケモン　トレ－ナ－だと　わかった▼
そんな　きみと　きみの　ポケモンに
であえたことを　よろこびたい▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T13:14:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ミクリ『すばらしい！▼
きみが　本当に　すばらしい！
ポケモン　トレ－ナ－だと　わかった▼
そんな　きみと　きみの　ポケモンに
出会えたことを　喜びたい▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T13:15:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・チャンピオン：ミクリ
・プレイヤーが勝った場合のメッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ECHAMPION
ミクリ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T10:17:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ECHAMPION_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_PLAYER_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ミクリ『きみの　ふんいきが
すこし　かわった▼
そう　おもえるときが　きたら
また　おあいしましょう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T13:14:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ミクリ『きみの　雰囲気が
少し　変わった▼
そう　思えるときが　きたら
また　お会いしましょう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T13:14:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・チャンピオン：ミクリ
・プレイヤーが負けた場合のメッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ECHAMPION
ミクリ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T10:17:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ECHAMPION_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>みずの　イリュージョニスト　ミクリ！
いま　ひのきぶたいに　あらわれるッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T12:39:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>水の　イリュージョニスト　ミクリ！
いま　ひのき舞台に　現れるッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T12:44:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：アナウンス
・チャンピオン：ミクリ
・前口上メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ECHAMPION
ミクリ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T10:17:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
