	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RGLEADER6_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_PLAYER_WIN"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>カツラ『み……　みごと！
わしは　もえつきた……！▼
だが　わしの　もえあがる　おもいは
さらに　つよくなるばかり……！▽
いつか　また　たたかおう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>カツラ『み……　みごと！
わしは　燃え尽きた……！▼
だが　わしの　燃えあがる　思いは
さらに　強くなるばかり……！▽
いつか　また　戦おう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
