	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RSLEADER1_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いわに　ときめく　ゆうとうせい！
ツツジ！　たたかえッ！　ときめけッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
