	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_DPLEADER2_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しげる　みどりの　ポケモンつかいは
みどりの　ゆびを　もつ　ナタネだぁ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
